            "review_title": "Review at Sai - Dog",
            "review_text": "Anh Pham\nMinnesota1 contribution\n0\nWorth it!!!\nOct 2019 • Solo\nSo compared with other local dishes, these hotdogs are a bit pricey but let me tell y'all its damn worth it. I just kept thinking about the time I paid $7 for a hotdog in MN state fair while I should've booked a ticket to Southend Asia for much more delicious, luxurious and cheaper food lol. I don't think it's the only hotdog place in town but it's the best one I've tried so far xD And if you're Marvel fan, definitely check this out, bc they have the Black Panther hotdogs that are as dark as my future :) jk its cool tho, highly recommend XD\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 16, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
