            "review_title": "Review at Sai - Dog",
            "review_text": "Cái Cây\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nHotdog for Saigonese\nOct 2019\nI live here, in Saigon. I love western food, especially hotdogs. But it seems very hard to find out a real hotdog here because we also have some foods called hotdog but totally different.\nWhen I found this restaurant, I was very happy. Prices are okay and the quality is very good. That is Saigon hotdog style !!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 10, 2019",
